  "prefLabel": "App 102.08 Employer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "App 102.08 \"Employer\" means any person or organization employing an apprentice, whether or not such person or organization is a party to an apprenticeship agreement with the apprentice.\n\nSource. #6364-A, eff 10-29-96",
